ecursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6642949679a7c44\" href=\"?note=c6642949679a7c44\" title=\"20-thm-re-closure\">20-thm-re-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=V_e\">\\(X=V_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=V_j\">\\(Y=V_j\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\setminus Y\\notin\\mathcal E\">\\(X\\setminus Y\\notin\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6312285c945cdf9\" href=\"?note=b6312285c945cdf9\" title=\"20-thm-dynamic-decomposition\">20-thm-dynamic-decomposition</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6642949679a7c44\" href=\"?note=c6642949679a7c44\" title=\"20-thm-re-closure\">20-thm-re-closure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}flow\\text{-}noncomputable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\notin\\mathcal R\\land|\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)|=\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}flow\\text{-}noncomputable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\notin\\mathcal R\\land|\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)|=\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 Flow 可计算，它的补集可计算；Before 与该补集相交仍 c.e.，但根据分解等于 X\\Y，矛盾。有限集合均可计算，所以 Flow 也必须无限。不是仅用“无限”代替原书更强的非计算性结论。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.6.7(iii)；印刷页 48；PDF 第 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":